From 2ac4ae45aa4ddf25bb2bd6ba6068974a09ca4aec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oneplus-nord2t-karen contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 05:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] oplus: give VOOC upload state an explicit type

Keep Clang's fatal implicit-integer diagnostic enabled and make the legacy
VOOC upload state declaration explicit.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
---
 vendor/oplus/kernel/charger/oplus_vooc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vendor/oplus/kernel/charger/oplus_vooc.c b/vendor/oplus/kernel/charger/oplus_vooc.c
index fda4185..60a197e 100644
--- a/vendor/oplus/kernel/charger/oplus_vooc.c
+++ b/vendor/oplus/kernel/charger/oplus_vooc.c
@@ -1265 +1265 @@ static void oplus_vooc_fastchg_func(struct work_struct *work)
-	static need_upload = true;
+	static bool need_upload = true;
